<span data-as="p">The <code>side</code> of a trade indicates the maker order side. The maker order is the order that was open on the order book.</span>
<span data-as="p">A <code>buy</code> side indicates a down-tick because the maker was a buy order and their order was removed. A <code>sell</code> side indicates an up-tick.</span>
